
                       geant4-11-02-ref-02
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Fixed spurious compilation warnings on gcc when LTO settings are enabled.
 o G4GammaGeneralProcess: fixed sampling of muon pair production.
 o G4eeToTwoGammaModel: fixed precision lost in sampling of final state
   for the very high energy.
 o Fixed elastic and capture cross-sections in Argon in particle-HP.
 o In G4BetaPlusDecay, G4BetaMinusDecay, added extra numerical protection
   to avoid precision loss and production of neutrino with negative kinetic
   energy.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------

(o)  Fixes included in patch release 11.2.1
(*)  Fixes included in patch release 11.2.2

