processes/hadronic
------------------
- cross_sections (hadr-cross-V11-02-01)
  o G4NeutronCapture: lowest energy limit is set to 10^-5 eV; below this
    energy no computations are done, to avoid numerical problems.
    Improved comments to the code.
  o G4NeutronInelastic: implemented 1/v cross-section dependence below
    low-energy limit of a cross-section vector, if cross-section does not
    start from null.
  o Moved G4IsotopeList header to 'util' module.
- models/fission (hadr-fission-V11-02-00)
  o G4FissLib: fixed compilation warning on gcc when LTO settings are enabled.
- models/lepto_nuclear (hadr-lepnuc-V11-02-00)
  o Fixed Coverity warning on unused variable in neutrino models.
- models/particle_hp (hadr-hpp-V11-02-03)
  o G4CrossSectionHP: fixed method taking into account temperature effect    (*)
    (the difference due to this fix is small).
    Fixed elastic and capture cross-sections in Argon, by using only the main
    isotope Z=18, A=40 (there was up to 50% overestimation of cross-sections
    due to wrong data for rare isotopes of argon).
    Fixed cross-sections for rare target atoms Promethium, Astatine, Radon
    and Francium.
  o G4ParticleHPFSFissionFS, G4ParticleHPFissionBaseFS: replaced use of      (o)
    C-arrays with std::vector, clearing compilation warnings on gcc
    compiler when LTO settings are enabled.
  o Fixed remaining compilation warnings on gcc compiler when LTO settings   (*)
    are enabled.
- models/parton_string/hadronization (had-hadronization-V11-02-00)
  o G4ExcitedStringDecay: fixed minor memory leak suggested by Coverity.
- models/radioactive_decay (radioactive_decay-V11-02-02)
  o G4BetaPlusDecay, G4BetaMinusDecay: added extra numerical protection on   (*)
    level of 1 eV to avoid precision loss and production of neutrino with
    negative kinetic energy.
  o G4BetaPlusDecay, G4BetaMinusDecay: fixed sampling algorithm.             (o)
    Addressing problem report #2588.
- util (hadr-util-V11-02-00)
  o Moved G4IsotopeList header with static data in this module, from
    'cross_sections'.

visualization
-------------
- management (visman-V11-02-08)
  o G4VisCommandsTouchable: "/vis/touchable/dump" and "findPath" do not need
    a scene handler nor a viewer.
    Moved them to the beginning of G4VisCommandsTouchable::SetNewValue(),
    before the check on scene handler and viewer. This allows the user to
    "/vis/touchable/dump" even if he/she has not yet opened a viewer.
  o G4VViewer: fixed Coverity reported defect.
  o G4VSceneHandler: fixed Coverity reported defect, use 'const auto&'
    instead of 'auto' to prevent copying.

